# Third-party notices

This file records the licences of third-party software that digithings
**redistributes inside images we publish**.

It is not a dependency inventory — that is what `pip-audit`, `npm-audit` and
`uv.lock` are for. A dependency you install at runtime in someone else's venv is
that operator's notice obligation. A dependency baked into an image under
`ghcr.io/digithings-ai/` is redistributed by us, and ships with whatever terms it
carries, to whoever pulls it.

Each entry records: what we redistribute, under what licence, from which source, at
which version, and — where it matters — what the licence does **not** cover.

> The general obligation to maintain this file is tracked separately on
> [DIG-1768](https://github.com/digithings-ai/digithings/issues/1768). Only the
> LiteLLM entry is recorded here, because DIG-1780 moved LiteLLM into an image we
> publish. Other images in `ghcr.io/digithings-ai/` are **not yet covered** — treat
> this file as incomplete until that work lands.

